#: phase5 templates/dashboard/_company_import_modal.html
msgctxt "companies.import"
msgid ""
"Additional standard columns (address, phone, NAICS / SIC codes, employee and"
" sales ranges, etc.) are optional and stored in their typed fields. Unknown "
"columns are preserved verbatim in Company.extra_data (JSONB). All rows go to"
" the tenant picked below. Duplicates on company name or registration_id are "
"skipped automatically."
msgstr ""
"Las columnas estándar adicionales (dirección, teléfono, códigos NAICS/SIC, "
"rangos de empleados y ventas, etc.) son opcionales y se almacenan en sus "
"campos escritos. Las columnas desconocidas se conservan palabra por palabra "
